<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 0.342 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 0.342 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International Ltd said the following FTSE 100 stocks will go ex-dividend on Monday and the effect will be to take 0.342 points off the index today.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>    * Asda Group		    0.81  1.01     0.173</p>
<p>    * Siebe			   4.90  6.13     0.169</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
